scene: {N} has led {place} by knowing best: {Ns} plans were right, and people followed them for that. This year one of {Ns} plans fails in plain sight, and everyone sees it fail. The losses are real, and {rival} reminds people that {rival} warned against it at the time. People who never questioned {N} now question everything.
