# Chroma library, modern Earth: WAYS TO LEAD, handing over (S7 ways to lead, v22.3, DRAFT cast_want: lead_hand).
# The character is the one in charge at {place} and the time to pass it on has come. The Engine fills {place}.
# Every option carries hand: chosen | open | stay (tableE.txt). Chances: per way, its one-letter option plus its cross
# (first letter) = 140, all in 50-90. Syntax: header of build.py.
#   pair 1  the end of a term    1a UR (s2) / 1b WBG (s3)
#   pair 2  late in life         2a WG (s4) / 2b UBR (s1)

