gap: 3-8
scene: {Ns} term in charge at {place} ends this season, and the place has done well under {N}. {colleague} has been doing more of the work lately and plainly wants the post. Others say quietly that {N} should simply carry on. Whatever form the handover takes, people are waiting for {N} to shape it.
