- W>B | hold a fair open contest by the book, and keep a say over the money yourself | hand: open | v: power, conformity | act: hold a fair open contest by the book, and keep a say over the money themselves | chance: 65
- U>R | stay one more term to see the bold project you designed come alive | hand: stay | v: achievement, stimulation | act: stay one more term to see the bold project they designed come alive | chance: 70
- B>G | call in your favours so that one of the place's own, not an outsider, takes over | hand: chosen | v: power, tradition | act: call in their favours so that one of the place's own, not an outsider, takes over | chance: 60
- R>W | rally everyone to an open vote, and make it a night where every voice counts | hand: open | v: stimulation, universalism | chance: 70
